# Vantage Admin Project Organization

`vantage-admin` is the Next.js 16 App Router owner/admin dashboard. Preserve ownership boundaries; put new work in the folder that owns the behavior.

**Environment variables:** [`docs/knowledge/environment.md`](../../docs/knowledge/environment.md). Read that inventory. Do not grep `process.env` to discover a name.

**Daily Operations (shipped):** Owner-only `/daily` after Overview. Category panels plus complementary Arrivals, New York-day counts, pace, live BFF. DOP-01–11 shipped; Arrivals is a live rail on the board. **DOP-10:** tiles + panel headers show `%` vs yesterday-by-now plus a visible yesterday / day-before line; Hourly rhythm chart; Quiet priorities / Sheet Sync / Colours in the chrome toolbar; every event kind has a colour tone with Owner overrides in `localStorage` (`vantage-admin-daily-kind-colors`); cards show every stored fact. **DOP-11:** `?lane=` is a solo Panel view (All panels clears it; replaces expand-in-place); full-stream overlay; enter/exit motion; like-hour baselines follow the browser clock; count per `event` (`metrics` ignored by the board); 5-min / hidden ≥ 240s / day-rollover snapshot resync; per-lane Load earlier; `lanesNeedingBackfill` includes `exception` (a panel count must not sit above an empty stack). Live `/` remains `HomeOverview` — Owner Waiting for you Booking intakes (existing open-case list; same **Finalize Booking** / **Possibly Fix Booking** / list **No Action** / optional **Cancel this booking** controls as `/intakes`), this-week pulse, compact all-time, create Booking/Cancellation. Cancellation intakes are not on Overview. Daily Operations is category panels plus complementary Arrivals, not Daily View, not Live Events, not a 24h/48h tabbed layout, not a sitemap, not a second Analytics. Confirm is not on `/daily`. Do not invent from `uxdocs/admin-operational-views-ux-proposal.md` or `uxdocs/owner-daily-view-planned.txt`. Contract: `vantage-main-server/docs/daily-operations/daily-operations-specification.md`. Pointer: `vantage-main-server/docs/knowledge/services/daily-operations.md`. Pack: `vantage-main-server/docs/daily-operations/`.

**Later contract (not implemented):** [`vantage-main-server/docs/granot-lead-lifecycle/release-into-booking-intake-specification.md`](../../../vantage-main-server/docs/granot-lead-lifecycle/release-into-booking-intake-specification.md) retires the cancellation intake tab. Rows below still describe the shipped Booking/Cancellation `/intakes` surface. Do not invent replacement UI from this map.

