## Auth & Proxy

- `proxy.ts` → cookie presence check → redirect to `/login`. Dashboard layout re-verifies JWT.
- Public: `/login`, `/api/*`, `/employee-booking`, legal pages, static assets.
- **Owner-only pages:** `/daily` (Daily Operations: category panels plus complementary Arrivals), `/audit-log`, `/bookings/reconciliation`, `/intakes` (Booking/Cancellation Granot cases), `/job-timeline` (typed Job Number owner chain), `/conversations` (searchable Lead Conversations), `/live-events` (Owner live Granot webhook SSE), `/manual` (create Form Lead / Call Lead + two-panel Connect Booking to Lead), `/extension` (create Extension User email, password, and role), `/ingestion/granot` (HTTP Automation; case/discrepancy URLs remain), `/granot-lifecycle` and `/granot-lifecycle/receipts` (Owner webhook-channel Granot Observation Receipt search). Exception: `/granot-lifecycle/health` is Owner/Admin because the server health GET is Owner/Admin and Observational links here. Admin cannot open `/daily`, `/granot-lifecycle`, or `/granot-lifecycle/receipts`. `/settings` is not owner-only: Admin can hit the permanent redirect and land on Operations Registry (already Admin-readable).
- Proxy flow: require admin session → validate relative path → `canProxyVantagePath(role, method, path)` → strip browser `x-api-secret`/`authorization`/`cookie` → set `x-vantage-admin-{user-id,email,role}` (+ optional HMAC via `VANTAGE_ADMIN_PROXY_SIGNING_SECRET`) → `server/vantage-api/client.ts` attaches `x-api-secret`.
- Non-owners: blocked from Daily Operations (`GET/POST /api/v1/admin/daily-operations*` and `/api/daily-operations-live`), reconciliation, Granot automation, Granot lifecycle **pages** (except Health) / candidates / creating-observation / Booking commands / Owner-only receipts list GET (`GET /api/v1/admin/granot-lifecycle/receipts` — Admin proxy 403), Connect Booking to Lead (`GET/POST /api/v1/admin/bookings/:bookingId/connect-lead*`), Google Drive, reporting mutations (GET reporting OK), registry mutations (some read-preview POSTs OK), DELETE, observability deletes, Owner `POST /api/v1/admin/sheet-sync/contains`, Extension User list/create (`GET/POST /api/v1/admin/extension-users`). Allowed: operational PATCH/POST, sheet-sync retry, incident status, observability report run, standard Granot lifecycle **GET** (cases/jobs/health, not candidates, creating-observation, live receipts, or the receipts list). Health GET stays Admin-readable.
- Never expose `VANTAGE_API_SECRET` or signing secrets to client / `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`.

